  # If you would rather the paper be cited instead of the code, rename this block
  # "preferred-citation" (a single entry, not a list) once the paper is published.
  - type: article
    title: "Determinants of FEV1 decline in cystic fibrosis in South Africa: a longitudinal cohort"
    authors:
